            "title": "Industrial Designer \u00b7 Product & Structural Design \u00b7 Mass Production \u00b7 Digital Sculptor",
            "bio": "I focus on product definition, CMF and structural prototyping for consumer electronics, home goods and tools. From early research to production follow-up, I take products from 0 to 1 end-to-end, and enjoy finding simple, durable solutions within constraints. This is a selection of recent work.",
